## 7. Breach, versions, and contact

Permission under this license terminates for a recipient who materially breaches its conditions. The recipient must cease uses that depend on the terminated permission. Reinstatement requires remedying the breach and written confirmation from the relevant Licensor; independent legal rights and exceptions remain unaffected. A recipient's breach does not by itself terminate permissions held by other recipients who comply with this license.

